('69b0dcdf-cd32-4ac8-af1a-0eb4539217ef','Microsoft Office 365 — Exclusive Reward Email Template','Exclusive Microsoft Office 365 Reward','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Exclusive Microsoft Office 365 Reward</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            width: 200px;\n        }\n\n        .content {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #777;\n        }\n\n        .footer img {\n            width: 50px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img alt=\"Microsoft Office 365 Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h2>Dear {{first_name}}\n                    {{last_name}},</h2>\n            <p>We are pleased to inform you that {{department}} has been selected to receive an exclusive reward from\n                Microsoft Office 365! This special offer is available for a limited time only, and we don’t want you to\n                miss out on this unique opportunity.</p>\n            <p><strong>To claim your\n                        exclusive Microsoft Office 365 reward, simply click on the link below within the next 24\n                    hours:</strong></p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                    s