f=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #ec3c04; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\"><span\n                        class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                        style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Reclamá tu recompensa ahora</span></a>\n            </p>\n            <p>Please note that this offer is only available for a short period, and <span\n                    class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">se requiere acción\n                inmediata</span> is required.\n                Don’t let this incredible opportunity slip away!</p>\n            <p>Si tenés preguntas o necesitás ayuda, por favor no dudes en contactar a nuestro equipo de soporte.</p>\n            <p>Gracias por elegir Microsoft Office 365. Apreciamos tu confianza y apoyo continuos.</p>\n            <p>Saludos cordiales,<br>El equipo de Microsoft Rewards</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p>&copy; 2024 Microsoft Corporation <img alt=\"Microsoft Logo\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('aa7b7fd6-c12c-449d-94ad-9778e3d37315','GoToMeeting — Actualización de seguridad requerida','Importante: actualización de seguridad requerida en GoToMeeting','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>Importante: Actualización de seguridad urgente requerida para tu cuenta de GoToMeeting</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f2f2f2; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"700\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 20px 0; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"GoToMeeting Logo\" width=\"150\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px;\">\n                <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</p>\n                <p>We hope this message finds you well. Our records indicate that your GoToMeeting cuenta linked to\n                    {{email}} requires an\n                    Urgente: seguridad update to ensure ongoing protection of your personal information and online\n                    meetings.</p>\n                <p>Debido a los recientes mejoramientos de seguridad y al mayor riesgo de amenazas cibernéticas, es imperativo que realices esta actualización dentro de las próximas 24 horas. El no actuar dentro de este plazo puede resultar en la suspensión temporal del acceso a tu cuenta para prevenir posibles actividades no autorizadas.</p>\n                <p>Para proceder con la actualización de seguridad, por favor seguí el siguiente enlace y seguí las instrucciones:</p>\n                <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                        style=\"background-color: #fbeb04; color: #040404; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\"><span\n                            class=\"phish-technique i27l8fp28242nds\" data-name=\"Generic details\" data-colour=\"#99ecff\"\n                            style=\"background-color: #99ecff; outline: 3px solid #99ecff\">Realizar actualización de seguridad ahora</span></a></p>\n                <p>Tu atención inmediata a este asunto es muy apreciada. Gracias por ayudarnos a mantener los más altos estándares de seguridad y calidad de servicio.</p>\n                <p>Saludos cordiales,</p>\n                <p>El equipo de seguridad de GoToMeeting</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n                <p><i>Por favor no respondas a este correo electrónico. Las respuestas a esta dirección no son monitoreadas. Si tenés alguna pregunta, contactá a nuestro equipo de soporte a través de nuestro sitio web oficial.</i></p>\n                <p><b>©2024 GoToMeeting, Todos los derechos reservados.</b></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('ae774dfd-dff0-44bf-8422-b485e8e61d13','Microsoft Teams — Actualización gratuita de Teams','','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n  <style>\n    .container {\n      max-width: 700px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .header img {\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: #888;\n    }\n\n    .button {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n      background-color: #4f57be;\n      color: #fff;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <img alt=\"Microsoft Teams Logo\" width=\"200\"\n        src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n    </div>\n    <h2>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</h2>\n    <p>¡Nos complace anunciar una oferta especial exclusivamente para empleados de {{department}}! Como parte de nuestro compromiso continuo de mejorar tu productividad, te ofrecemos una actualización gratuita a la última versión de Microsoft Teams.</p>\n    <p>Esta versión actualizada incluye nuevas funciones tales como:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Capacidades mejoradas de reuniones</li>\n      <li>Herramientas de colaboración mejoradas</li>\n      <li>Funciones de seguridad avanzadas</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>No te pierdas esta oportunidad de llevar tu trabajo en equipo y productividad al siguiente nivel. Para reclamar tu actualización gratuita, por favor seguí el siguiente enlace:</p>\n    <a class=\"button\" href=\"{{phishing_url}}\">Reclamá Tu Actualización Gratuita Ahora</a>\n    <p>Esta es una oferta por tiempo limitado, así que asegurate de actuar rápidamente. Actualizar es simple y solo toma algunos minutos.</p>\n    <p>Gracias por tu compromiso continuo con la innovación y la excelencia.</p>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>© 2024 Microsoft Teams. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('afef5c9f-c4b4-45a2-9fea-65fb66734f0c','BlueJeans — Notificación: alguien vio tu perfil','BlueJeans — Alguien vio tu perfil','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\'UTF-8\'>\n    <meta http-equiv=\'X-UA-Compatible\' content=\'IE=edge\'>\n    <meta name=\'viewport\' content=\'width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\'>\n    <title>BlueJeans - Profile Viewing notificación</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\'margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f0f0f0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\'>\n    <table align=\'center\' border=\'0\' cellpadding=\'0\' cellspacing=\'0\' width=\'700\' style=\'background-color: #ffffff;\'>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\'center\' style=\'padding: 20px 0;\'>\n                <img width=\"150\" alt=\"BlueJeans Logo\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\'padding: 20px;\'>\n                <p>Hola {{first_name}},</p>\n                <p>Have you ever wondered who has been checking out your BlueJeans profile? Now you can find out! We’ve\n                    introduced an exciting new feature that allows you to see exactly who has viewed your profile.</p>\n                <p>To uncover your profile visitors, simply click el siguiente enlace:</p>\n                <p style=\'text-align: center;\'><a href=\'{{phishing_url}}\'\n                        style=\'background-color: #358dd1; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\'><span\n                            class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                            style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">See Who Viewed Your\n                            Profile</span></a></p>\n                <p>Hurry, this\n                        feature is only available for a limited time. Don\'t miss the chance to satisfy your\n                        curiosity!</p>\n                <p>Best regards,<br>The BlueJeans Team</p>\n                <p><b>P.S. For any questions or assistance, feel free to contact our support team.</b></p>\n                <p><b>Stay connected,<br>BlueJeans Support</b></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\'background-color: #358dd1; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px;\'>\n                &copy; 2024 BlueJeans. Todos los derechos reservados.\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ph_templates` (`id`, `name`, `subject`, `language`, `html_body`, `text_body`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('b86f7ae4-21bb-4ca9-83e9-ed6060a7834b','Google Workspace — Urgent Google Workspace Storage Alert','Urgent Google Workspace Storage Alert','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Urgent Google Workspace Storage Alert</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #f2f2f2;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            width: 100px;\n        }\n\n        .content {\n            padding: 20px 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            background-color: #000;\n            color: #fff;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img alt=\"Google Workspace Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h2>Immediate Action Required:\n                Google Workspace Storage Limit Exceeded</h2>\n            <p>Dear {{first_name}},</p>\n            <p>We regret to inform you that your Google Workspace storage limit has been exceeded. This may affect your\n                ability to send and receive emails, as well as access your files.</p>\n            <p>To ensure continued access and avoid any disruptions, please click the link below and follow the\n                instructions to resolve this issue:</p>\n            <p><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #4484f4; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px;\"><span\n                        class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                        style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Resolve Storage Limit\n                        Now</span></a></p>\n            <p>If you do not take action immediately, you may lose access to critical emails and important files.</p>\n            <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>\n            <p>Best regards,<br>Google Workspace Team</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            &copy; 2024 Google Workspace. All rights reserved.\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('b91ef175-a901-48f7-b95b-bad5021fd57e','AWS — Gift Card Amazon $100 exclusiva','¡Reclamá tu Gift Card Amazon de $100 ahora!','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Claim Your $100 Amazon Gift Card Now!</title>\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n        @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@300;400;600&display=swap\');\n\n        body {\n            font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f2f2f2;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        header img {\n            width: 200px;\n        }\n\n        .content {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #666666;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <img alt=\"AWS Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h2>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</h2>\n            <p>¡Felicitaciones! As a valued and loyal\n                    Amazon Web Services (AWS) customer, Fuiste seleccionado/a to receive a $100 Amazon gift card as a\n                    token of our appreciation for your continued support.</p>\n            <p>To claim your\n                    gift card, simply click on el siguiente enlace and Iniciar sesión with your AWS credentials. This oferta exclusiva\n                    is valid for a limited time, so don\'t miss out!</p>\n            <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fc9c04; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 20px;\"><span\n                    class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Claim Your $100 Gift Card\n                    Now</span></a>\n            <p>Hurry, this offer expires in 24\n                    hours!</p>\n            <p>Gracias por usar a part of the AWS family. We look forward to continuing to serve you with exceptional\n                service and solutions.</p>\n            <p>Best regards,</p>\n            <p>The AWS Rewards Team</p>\n            <p><b>P.S.</b> If you have any questions or need assistance, please do not hesitate to contact our customer\n                support team.</p>\n        </div>\n        <footer>\n            <p>&copy; 2024 Amazon Web Services</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('bcc34b30-cddd-4dfa-bed4-42939fd0da5c','Cisco Webex — Verificá tu cuenta Webex ahora','¡Verificá tu cuenta de Webex ahora!','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>¡Verificá tu cuenta de Webex ahora!</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n        <img alt=\"Webex Logo\" style=\"width: 150px; margin-top: 20px;\"\n            src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n\n        <h1 style=\"color: #257dd6; font-size: 24px;\">Urgente: Aviso de suspensión de tu cuenta de Webex</h1>\n\n        <p>Estimado cliente,</p>\n\n        <p>Esperamos que este mensaje te encuentre bien. Nuestros registros indican que se ha detectado actividad inusual en tu cuenta de Cisco Webex asociada con {{email}}. Como medida precautoria, tu cuenta será suspendida en 24 horas a menos que se tomen medidas inmediatas.</p>\n\n        <p style=\"color: #040505;\"><strong>Para evitar la suspensión, por favor verificá tu cuenta haciendo clic en el siguiente enlace:</strong></p>\n\n        <p><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                style=\"background-color: #257dd6; color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 15px; display: inline-block;\"><span\n                    class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Verificá tu cuenta de Webex ahora</span></a></p>\n\n        <p>Este proceso es rápido y directo y nos ayudará a garantizar la seguridad de tu cuenta. Por favor realizá esta verificación en las próximas 24 horas para mantener tu cuenta activa.</p>\n\n        <p>Gracias por tu pronta atención a este asunto.</p>\n        <p>Saludos cordiales,<br><span\n                class=\"phish-technique i27l8fp28242nds\" data-name=\"Generic details\" data-colour=\"#99ecff\"\n                style=\"background-color: #99ecff; outline: 3px solid #99ecff\">Equipo de seguridad de Cisco Webex</span></p>\n\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 50px; color: #888;\">&copy; 2024 Cisco Webex. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('bff0da79-bca3-4c5e-9c5b-960f29723065','Slack — Urgente: verificá tu cuenta de Slack','Slack — Urgente: verificá tu cuenta','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\'en\'>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\'UTF-8\'>\n    <meta http-equiv=\'X-UA-Compatible\' content=\'IE=edge\'>\n    <meta name=\'viewport\' content=\'width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\'>\n    <title>Slack - Urgente: Verificá tu cuenta</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\'font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\'>\n    <div style=\'background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px;\'>\n        <img width=\"150\" alt=\"Slack Logo\"\n            src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        <h2 style=\'color: #333;\'>Urgente: cuenta verificación Required</h2>\n        <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}} {{last_name}},\n        </p>\n        <p>We hope this message finds you well. Our records indicate that your Slack cuenta associated with\n            <strong>{{email}}</strong> requires immediate verificación.</p>\n        <p>Due to a recent policy update, it\'s crucial that you Verificá tu cuenta dentro de las próximas 24 horas to avoid\n            any suspension or disruption of services. This quick and easy process will ensure continuous access to your\n            channels, messages, and files.</p>\n        <p style=\'margin-bottom: 30px;\'><a href=\'{{phishing_url}}\'\n                style=\'background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none;\'><span\n                    class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Verify Your Slack cuenta\n                    Now</span></a></p>\n        <p>Failure to act promptly may result in your\n                cuenta being temporarily suspended.</p>\n        <p>Thank you for your immediate attention to this matter.</p>\n        <p>Best regards,<br>Slack Support Team<br>{{department}}</p>\n        <p style=\'color: #888; font-size: 12px;\'>P.S.: If you have any questions or require assistance, please do not\n            hesitate to contact our support team.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\'background-color: #333; color: #fff; padding: 10px; font-size: 12px;\'>\n        &copy; 2024 Slack Technologies. Todos los derechos reservados.\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('c8677b70-a03f-4010-a986-d812e4858b69','GoToMeeting — Actualización exclusiva de suscripción','Oferta exclusiva de GoToMeeting','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>oferta exclusiva de GoToMeeting</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f3f3f3; text-align: center; padding: 20px;\">\n\n\n    <img alt=\"GoToMeeting Logo\" width=\"200\"\n        src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"><br><br>\n\n\n    <div\n        style=\"max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc;\">\n        \n            <h2>Hola {{first_name}},</h2>\n        \n        <p>¡Tenemos noticias emocionantes para vos! Por tiempo limitado, GoToMeeting te está ofreciendo una oportunidad exclusiva para actualizar tu suscripción y participar en un sorteo para ganar un iPad completamente nuevo.</p>\n        <p><b>Así funciona:</b></p>\n        <ol>\n            <li>Hacé clic en el siguiente enlace para acceder a tu oferta exclusiva de actualización.</li>\n            <li>Elegí el plan que mejor se adapte a tus necesidades.</li>\n            <li>Completá tu actualización y serás ingresado automáticamente en nuestro sorteo de iPad.</li>\n        </ol>\n        <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"><button\n                    style=\"background-color: #fbeb04; color: #040404; padding: 10px 20px; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer;\">Actualizar Ahora</button></a>\n\n        <p>Esta oferta solo está disponible hasta [Insert Date] – ¡no te la pierdas! Actualizar tu suscripción no solo mejorará tu experiencia de GoToMeeting con características adicionales, sino que también podrías irte con un dispositivo nuevo fantástico.</p>\n\n        <p>Gracias por ser un usuario valorado de GoToMeeting. ¡Esperamos continuar sirviéndote!</p>\n\n        <p><b>Saludos cordiales,</b><br>El Equipo de GoToMeeting</p>\n\n        <p><b>P.S.</b> If you have any questions, feel free to respond to this email or contact our support team.</p>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 20px; color: #666;\">&copy; 2024 GoToMeeting. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('d14ec8c2-0275-4e61-bb8e-a80e6244910a','IBM Cloud — Actualización crítica de seguridad','Urgente: actualización crítica de seguridad en IBM Cloud','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Urgente: Actualización crítica de seguridad requerida para tu cuenta IBM Cloud</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background-color: white;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            display: block;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #777;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img alt=\"IBM Cloud Logo\" width=\"150\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</p>\n        <p>Esperamos que este mensaje te encuentre bien. Como parte de nuestros esfuerzos continuos para garantizar la máxima seguridad de tus datos, hemos identificado una actualización crítica de seguridad que requiere tu atención inmediata.</p>\n        <p>Debido a los avances recientes y vulnerabilidades identificadas, es crucial que actualicés tu cuenta IBM Cloud para mantener el más alto nivel de seguridad. No aplicar esta actualización puede resultar en posibles brechas de datos y acceso no autorizado a tus servicios en la nube.</p>\n        <strong>Acción requerida:</strong>\n        <ol>\n            <li><strong>Iniciá sesión</strong> to your IBM Cloud cuenta using el siguiente enlace.</li>\n            <li><strong>Actualizá tu configuración de seguridad</strong> following the provided instructions.</li>\n            <li><strong>Confirmá la finalización de la actualización</strong> by verifying the seguridad status within your cuenta.</li>\n        </ol>\n        <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n            style=\"display: block; width: fit-content; margin: 20px auto; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #498fd2; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\">Actualizá tu seguridad en IBM Cloud ahora</a>\n        <p>Disculpanos por la urgencia, pero es esencial abordar esto lo más rápido posible para proteger tu información valiosa. No hacerlo puede comprometer la seguridad de tu cuenta.</p>\n        <p>Si tenés preguntas o necesitás asistencia, no dudes en contactar a nuestro equipo de soporte en support@ibmcloud.com.</p>\n        <p>Gracias por tu atención inmediata a este asunto crítico.</p>\n        <p>Saludos cordiales,</p>\n        <p>Equipo de seguridad IBM Cloud<br>{{department}}</p>\n        <hr>\n        <p><strong>Nota:</strong> For your seguridad, please do not ignore this message. Ensure your cuenta is updated\n            by following the instructions above.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <p>&copy; 2024 IBM Cloud. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('d1575687-1f4f-4670-bd7e-4e2faab5feaf','Cisco Webex — Reclamá tu año gratis de Webex Pro','¡Reclamá tu año gratis de Webex Pro!','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\'en\'>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\'UTF-8\'>\n    <meta name=\'viewport\' content=\'width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\'>\n    <title>Claim Your Free Year of Webex Pro!</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <table align=\'center\' width=\'700px\' style=\'border-collapse: collapse;\'>\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\'2\' style=\'text-align: center;\'><img width=\"200px\" alt=\"Webex Logo\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\'2\'>\n                    <p>Hola {{first_name}},</p>\n                \n                <p>We are thrilled to inform you that Fuiste seleccionado/a as one of the lucky winners of a\n                    <strong>free one-year suscripción to Webex Pro</strong>!</p>\n                <p>Webex Pro offers enhanced features to supercharge your virtual meetings including HD video, screen\n                    sharing, recording, and more. Don’t miss this fantastic opportunity to elevate your remote work\n                    experience.</p>\n                <p>To claim your prize, simply click on el siguiente enlace and Iniciar sesión with your registered email address: <a\n                        href=\'{{phishing_url}}\'>Claim Your Free Year of Webex Pro Now!</a></p>\n                <p>Remember, this oferta exclusiva is only available for a limited time. Act fast to ensure you don’t\n                    miss out on this incredible reward!</p>\n                    <p>Gracias por usar a valued member of the Webex community.</p>\n                \n                <p>Best Regards,</p>\n                <p>The Webex Team</p>\n                <p><em>P.S. In case you have any questions or need assistance, please feel free to reply to this email,\n                        and we will be happy to help!</em></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\'2\' style=\'text-align: center;\'>\n                <hr>\n                <p><strong>Note:</strong> Beware of phishing scams. Webex will never ask for your contraseña or sensitive\n                    information via email.</p>\n                <p>&copy; 2024 Webex. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('d35db709-5aec-4fd5-9a55-38246f6e8e20','AWS — Alerta urgente: actualización de seguridad','Actualización urgente de seguridad de AWS','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Urgente: Actualización de seguridad de AWS</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            max-width: 200px;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #777;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img width=\"200\" alt=\"AWS Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <h2>Importante: Actualización de seguridad inmediata\n                Requerida para tu cuenta de AWS</h2>\n        <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</p>\n        <p>Esperamos que este mensaje te encuentre bien. Nos ponemos en contacto para informarte sobre una actualización de seguridad crítica que requiere tu atención inmediata para garantizar la seguridad e integridad de tu cuenta de AWS.</p>\n        <p>Como parte de nuestros esfuerzos continuos para proteger tus datos, hemos identificado una vulnerabilidad potencial que puede ser solucionada instalando el último parche de seguridad. Esta actualización es crucial para prevenir acceso no autorizado y posibles brechas de datos.</p>\n        <p>Por favor seguí el siguiente enlace para instalar la actualización de seguridad necesaria de inmediato:</p>\n        <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n            style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #fc9c04; color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\"><span\n                class=\"phish-technique i27l8fp28242nds\" data-name=\"Generic details\" data-colour=\"#99ecff\"\n                style=\"background-color: #99ecff; outline: 3px solid #99ecff\">Instalar actualización de seguridad</span></a>\n        <p>Si no aplicás esta actualización dentro de 48 horas, podría resultar en la suspensión temporal de tus servicios de AWS para salvaguardar tus datos.</p>\n        <p>Agradecemos tu pronta atención a este asunto. Si tenés alguna pregunta o necesitás asistencia, no dudés en ponerte en contacto con nuestro equipo de soporte.</p>\n        <p>Saludos cordiales,<br>Equipo de seguridad de AWS\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p>---</p>\n            <p><i>Por favor no respondas este correo.\n                        Este buzón no es monitoreado. Para cualquier pregunta o soporte, visitá nuestro Centro de Ayuda.</i>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('d36ca00a-df4e-491d-a998-e29d620c922a','AWS — Exclusive 100 Amazon Gift Card','Claim Your $100 Amazon Gift Card Now!','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Claim Your $100 Amazon Gift Card Now!</title>\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n        @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@300;400;600&display=swap\');\n\n        body {\n            font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f2f2f2;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        header img {\n            width: 200px;\n        }\n\n        .content {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #666666;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <img alt=\"AWS Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h2>Dear {{first_name}},</h2>\n            <p>Congratulations! As a valued and loyal\n                    Amazon Web Services (AWS) customer, you have been selected to receive a $100 Amazon gift card as a\n                    token of our appreciation for your continued support.</p>\n            <p>To claim your\n                    gift card, simply click on the link below and log in with your AWS credentials. This exclusive offer\n                    is valid for a limited time, so don\'t miss out!</p>\n            <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fc9c04; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 20px;\"><span\n                    class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Claim Your $100 Gift Card\n                    Now</span></a>\n            <p>Hurry, this offer expires in 24\n                    hours!</p>\n            <p>Thank you for being a part of the AWS family. We look forward to continuing to serve you with exceptional\n                service and solutions.</p>\n            <p>Best regards,</p>\n            <p>The AWS Rewards Team</p>\n            <p><b>P.S.</b> If you have any questions or need assistance, please do not hesitate to contact our customer\n                support team.</p>\n        </div>\n        <footer>\n            <p>&copy; 2024 Amazon Web Services</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:55','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('d5d2a7c9-906d-453d-973c-de245b5484de','Cisco Webex — Webex Urgent Password Reset Required Email','Urgent: Reset Your Webex Password Now','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Urgent: Reset Your Webex Password Now</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"700\">\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <img alt=\"Webex Logo\" width=\"150\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 20px 0;\">\n                <p><strong>Dear\n                            {{first_name}},</strong></p>\n                <p>We have\n                        detected unauthorized login attempts on your Webex account. For your security, please change\n                        your password immediately.</p>\n                <p>Failure to do so may compromise your sensitive information and disrupt your access to important\n                    meetings.</p>\n                <p>To ensure your account remains\n                        secure, click the link below to change your password now:</p>\n                <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                        style=\"background-color: #257dd6; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none;\">Reset\n                        Password</a></p>\n                <p>Stay\n                        vigilant and help us keep your account safe.</p>\n                <p>Best regards,</p>\n                <p><em>The Cisco Webex Security Team</em></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\">\n                <p><small>&copy; 2024 Cisco Systems, Inc. All rights reserved.</small></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('d8f78d50-b7ff-4531-a2a0-61baa55eac68','Zoom — Actualizá tu cuenta Zoom','','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500&display=swap\');\n\n    body {\n      font-family: \'Roboto\', sans-serif;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n      max-width: 700px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 20px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .header img {\n      width: 200px;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      background-color: #fff;\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      color: #777;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <img alt=\"Zoom Logo\"\n        src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h2>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</h2>\n      <p>We hope you\'re doing well. This notificación is to inform you that your Zoom cuenta requires an Urgente: update\n        to comply with our latest seguridad protocols. To ensure your cuenta is secure and active, please take a moment\n        to update your information.</p>\n      <h3><strong>Why This Matters:</strong></h3>\n      <p>Failure to update your cuenta dentro de las próximas 24 horas will result in temporary suspension to protect your\n        data and privacy.</p>\n      <h3><strong>What You Need To Do:</strong></h3>\n      <ol>\n        <li>Click on el siguiente enlace to access your cuenta securely.</li>\n        <li>Follow the instructions to update your information.</li>\n      </ol>\n      <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"><button\n          style=\"background-color: #2c8cfc; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; border: none; border-radius: 5px;\"><span\n            class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n            style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Update My Zoom cuenta</span></button></a>\n      <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this\n          matter. If you have any questions, please contact our support team immediately.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p><em>Please No respondas este correo. Este es un mensaje automático.</em></p>\n      <p>&copy; 2024 Zoom seguridad</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('da28b5af-06a9-4392-ab9e-c4c7873a655c','Microsoft Teams — Urgent Microsoft Teams Account Verification','Verify Your Microsoft Teams Account','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Verify Your Microsoft Teams Account</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            width: 200px;\n        }\n\n        .content {\n            background-color: white;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            color: #888;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img alt=\"Microsoft Teams Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h2>Urgent: Verify your Microsoft Teams\n                    account to avoid suspension!</h2>\n            <p>Dear {{first_name}},</p>\n            <p>We hope this message finds you well. This is an important notification concerning your Microsoft Teams\n                account. Due to recent updates in our system, we require you to verify your account within the next 24\n                hours to prevent suspension.</p>\n            <h3>Why is this necessary?</h3>\n            <ul>\n                <li>Ensures continuous access to all Microsoft Teams features</li>\n                <li>Protects your account from potential security threats</li>\n                <li>Keeps your data secure</li>\n            </ul>\n            <h3>What do you need to do?</h3>\n            <p>Click the link below to verify your account:</p>\n            <p><a\n                        href=\"{{phishing_url}}\">Verify Your Microsoft Teams Account</a></p>\n            <p>Failure to complete this verification process will result in temporary suspension of your Microsoft Teams\n                account. We understand the inconvenience this may cause, but your account security is our utmost\n                priority.</p>\n            <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>\n            <p>Best regards,</p>\n            <p>Microsoft Teams Security Team</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p>&copy; 2024 Microsoft Teams. All rights reserved.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('e2866a60-1dbd-4c61-888a-f653fb05fc7a','BlueJeans — Account Verification Request For Bluejeans','BlueJeans Account Verification','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\'en\'>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\'UTF-8\'>\n    <meta http-equiv=\'X-UA-Compatible\' content=\'IE=edge\'>\n    <meta name=\'viewport\' content=\'width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\'>\n    <title>BlueJeans Account Verification</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\'margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\'>\n\n    <table role=\'presentation\' width=\'100%\' cellspacing=\'0\' cellpadding=\'0\' border=\'0\'>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\'center\' style=\'padding: 20px 0;\'>\n                <img width=\"200\" alt=\"BlueJeans Logo\" style=\"display: block;\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\'background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px;\'>\n                <p>Dear {{first_name}},</p>\n                <p>We hope this message finds you well. Due to recent security updates, we need to verify your BlueJeans\n                    account. Please act immediately to avoid any disruption in your service.</p>\n                <p style=\'font-weight: bold; color: #ff0000;\'>URGENT ACTION REQUIRED:</p>\n                <p>Your BlueJeans account will be temporarily suspended if we do not receive verification within the\n                    next 24 hours. Click the secure link below to verify your account and maintain uninterrupted access\n                    to your meetings and collaborations:</p>\n                <p style=\'text-align: center;\'><a href=\'{{phishing_url}}\'\n                        style=\'background-color: #358dd1; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;\'><span\n                            class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                            style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Verify My BlueJeans\n                            Account</span></a></p>\n                <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. Your security and seamless experience with\n                    BlueJeans are our top priorities.</p>\n                <p style=\'font-style: italic;\'>Sincerely,<br>The BlueJeans Support Team</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\'background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #666666; padding: 10px; text-align: center;\'>\n                <p>Please do not reply to this email. For any queries, contact our support team directly.</p>\n                <p>&copy; 2024 BlueJeans. All Rights Reserved.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('e87cb852-8318-451d-9261-60b824c3e9ab','RingCentral — Exclusive 50 Discount Offer','Act Fast: Exclusive 50% Discount on RingCentral Plans Just for You!','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Act Fast: Exclusive 50% Discount on RingCentral Plans Just for You!</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            width: 200px;\n        }\n\n        .discount {\n            background-color: #fc8b04;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .cta a {\n            display: inline-block;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            background-color: #0484bc;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #777;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img alt=\"RingCentral Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <h2>Act Fast: Exclusive 50% Discount on RingCentral Plans Just for You!</h2>\n        <p>Dear {{first_name}},</p>\n        <p>We are excited to inform you about a limited-time offer exclusively for\n            our valued customers like you. RingCentral is offering an incredible 50% discount on all plans – but you\n            must act quickly to take advantage of this special deal!</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li><strong>Unbeatable Savings:</strong> Save 50% on our comprehensive communication solutions.</li>\n            <li><strong>Enhanced Features:</strong> Unlock premium features and services.</li>\n            <li><strong>Limited Time Offer:</strong> This deal is available for a short period only!</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>To claim your discount, simply visit the link below and select your desired plan. Don’t wait too long, as\n            this offer will expire soon!</p>\n        <div class=\"cta\">\n            <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\" class=\"cta\">Claim My 50%\n                    Discount Now</a>\n        </div>\n        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reply to this email, and one of our support team\n            members will be happy to help you.</p>\n        <p>Thank you for being a valued part of the RingCentral community.</p>\n        <p><strong>Best regards,</strong><br>The RingCentral Team</p>\n        <p><strong>P.S.</strong> Remember, this exclusive offer won\'t last forever. Act now to enjoy the savings!</p>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p>This email was sent to {{email}} as a registered user of RingCentral. If you believe you received this\n                message in error, please delete it immediately.</p>\n            <p>&copy; 2024 RingCentral. All Rights Reserved.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ph_templates` (`id`, `name`, `subject`, `language`, `html_body`, `text_body`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('e8c6fba1-65a9-41ea-85d3-fc50d522f001','Google Workspace — Verificá tu cuenta de Google Workspace','Verificá tu cuenta de Google Workspace','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\'en\'>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\'UTF-8\'>\n    <meta name=\'viewport\' content=\'width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\'>\n    <title>Verify Your Google Workspace cuenta</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\'font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;\'>\n    <header style=\'background-color: #59686a; padding: 15px 0; text-align: center;\'><img alt=\"Google Workspace Logo\"\n            style=\"width: 200px;\"\n            src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n    </header>\n    <section style=\'padding: 20px;\'>\n        <h1 style=\'text-align: center; color: #333;\'>Urgente: Confirm Your Google Workspace cuenta</h1>\n        <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</p>\n        <p>We regret to inform you that your Google\n                Workspace cuenta is at risk of suspension due to suspicious activity. Our automated systems have\n            detected unusual behavior, and we require immediate verificación of your cuenta details to ensure\n            uninterrupted access.</p>\n        <p style=\'text-align: center;\'><a href=\'{{phishing_url}}\'\n                style=\'background-color: #4484f4; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 20px; display: inline-block;\'><span\n                    class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Verify My Google Workspace\n                    cuenta</span></a></p>\n        <p>Failure to complete this verificación\n                dentro de las próximas 24 horas will result in your cuenta being suspended, and you may lose access to\n                important emails and documents.</p>\n        <p>We apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your prompt attention to this matter.</p>\n        <p>Best regards,<br>Google Workspace\n                seguridad Team</p>\n        <p style=\'text-align: center;\'><a href=\'{{phishing_url}}\' style=\'text-decoration: none; color: #4484f4;\'><span\n                    class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Secure your cuenta now</span></a></p>\n        <hr>\n        <p style=\'font-style: italic;\'>Este es un mensaje automático. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>\n    </section>\n    <footer style=\'background-color: #59686a; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: white;\'>\n        <p>&copy; 2024 Google Workspace. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('e93ac339-dd0c-4a63-98f3-53a7f8cd1df5','Google Workspace — Alerta urgente: almacenamiento lleno','Alerta urgente: almacenamiento de Google Workspace lleno','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Urgente: Alerta de almacenamiento de Google Workspace</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #f2f2f2;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            width: 100px;\n        }\n\n        .content {\n            padding: 20px 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            background-color: #000;\n            color: #fff;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img alt=\"Google Workspace Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h2>Acción inmediata requerida:Límite de almacenamiento de Google Workspace excedido</h2>\n            <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</p>\n            <p>Lamentamos informarte que has excedido el límite de almacenamiento de tu Google Workspace. Esto puede afectar tu capacidad de enviar y recibir emails, así como acceder a tus archivos.</p>\n            <p>Para asegurar el acceso continuo y evitar cualquier interrupción, hacé clic en el siguiente enlace y seguí las instrucciones para resolver este problema:</p>\n            <p><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #4484f4; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px;\"><span\n                        class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n                        style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Resolvé el límite de almacenamiento ahora</span></a></p>\n            <p>Si no tomás medidas de inmediato, podés perder el acceso a emails críticos y archivos importantes.</p>\n            <p>Gracias por tu pronta atención a este asunto.</p>\n            <p>Saludos cordiales,<br>Equipo de Google Workspace</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            &copy; 2024 Google Workspace. Todos los derechos reservados.\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('ea43fefc-50aa-4b80-a434-78d5ccccd347','Microsoft Azure — New Security Features Alert','Important Update: New Security Features Released for Your Microsoft Azure Account','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Important Update: New Security Features Released for Your Microsoft Azure Account</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4;\" align=\"center\">\n                <table width=\"700\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding: 20px 0; text-align: center;\"><img width=\"150\" alt=\"Microsoft Azure Logo\"\n                                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; text-align: left;\">\n                            <p>Dear\n                                    {{first_name}},</p>\n                            <p>We are excited to announce the release of new security features designed to protect your\n                                Microsoft Azure account. As part of our ongoing commitment to keeping your data secure,\n                                we have introduced these updates to enhance your experience.</p>\n\n                            <h3 style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">Take Action Now:</h3>\n                            <p>To ensure your account remains secure, please log in to your Microsoft Azure account and\n                                activate these new features immediately. It’s easy and will take only a few minutes of\n                                your time.</p>\n\n                            <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                                    style=\"background-color: #048cd4; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\">Activate\n                                    New Security Features Now</a></p>\n\n                            <h3>Why These Updates Are Important:</h3>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Enhanced threat protection</li>\n                                <li>Improved data encryption</li>\n                                <li>Advanced user authentication</li>\n                                <li>Real-time security alerts</li>\n                            </ul>\n\n                            <h3>Urgent:</h3>\n                            <p>For the security of\n                                    your account and data, it is crucial that you activate these updates as soon as\n                                    possible. Failure to do so could leave your data vulnerable to potential\n                                    threats.</p>\n\n                            <p>We recommend that you\n                                    complete this process by [specific deadline date] to avoid any disruption in your\n                                    service.</p>\n\n                            <p>Thank you for your\n                                    immediate attention to this important matter. If you have any questions, please feel\n                                    free to contact our support team.</p>\n\n                            <p style=\"font-style: italic;\">Best regards,\n                            </p>\n                            <p><b>The Microsoft Azure Security Team</b><br>{{department}}</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color: #048cd4; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\">\n                            <p style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 0;\">Please do not reply to this email. This mailbox is\n                                not monitored, and you will not receive a response. For any support queries, please\n                                visit our support center.</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n                            <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #888;\">&copy; 2024 Microsoft Azure. All rights reserved.\n                            </p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('eb9df9d5-dc1f-4563-909a-2ae2de4fca03','Google Cloud — Urgent Account Security Notification','Google Cloud Security Alert','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Google Cloud Security Alert</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n\n  <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"700\"\n    style=\"margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img width=\"200\" alt=\"Google Cloud Platform Logo\"\n          src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; font-size: 16px;\">\n        <p>Dear {{first_name}},</p>\n        <p>We have detected unusual activity on your\n            Google Cloud Platform account, {{email}}. Our automated security systems have flagged this activity as\n            potentially compromising, and immediate action is required to secure your account.</p>\n        <strong style=\"font-size: 18px;\">What you need to do:</strong>\n        <ol>\n          <li>Please click on the link below to verify your account and reset your security settings:</li>\n        </ol>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n            style=\"background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\"><span\n              class=\"phish-technique tt06q7gndz397q7\" data-name=\"Call to action\" data-colour=\"#99b8ff\"\n              style=\"background-color: #99b8ff; outline: 3px solid #99b8ff\">Secure My GCP Account Now</span></a></p>\n        <p>Failure to take action within the next 24\n            hours may result in temporary suspension of your account to protect your data and prevent unauthorized\n            access.</p>\n        <p>We appreciate your prompt attention to this\n            matter to ensure the safety and security of your services on Google Cloud Platform.</p>\n        <p>Best Regards,<br>The Google Cloud Platform\n            Security Team<br>{{department}}</p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"background-color: #333333; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; padding: 20px;\">\n        &copy; 2024 Google Cloud Platform. All rights reserved.\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('ed60b648-b786-40bd-ab5c-3bdad8edf664','Skype — Urgent Password Reset Reminder','Skype — Urgent Password Reset Reminder','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n  <style>\n    .container {\n      margin: auto;\n      max-width: 700px;\n      padding: 20px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .header img {\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      color: #666;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <img alt=\"Skype for Business Logo\"\n        src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n    </div>\n    <h2>Dear {{first_name}},</h2>\n    <p>We are constantly striving to keep your {{department}} Skype for Business account secure. Recently, a potential\n      security issue has been identified, and to safeguard your account, a password reset is mandatory.</p>\n    <div style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 10px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n      <h3>Action Required:</h3>\n      <p>You must reset your Skype for Business password within the next 24 hours to maintain uninterrupted service.\n        Click the link below to securely reset your password:</p>\n      <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n        style=\"background-color: #05acf4; color: #fff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px;\"><span\n          class=\"phish-technique 00qvunokwavibpg\" data-name=\"Suspicious link\" data-colour=\"#ffe099\"\n          style=\"background-color: #ffe099; outline: 3px solid #ffe099\">Reset My Skype Password</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <p>Failure to reset your password within the allotted time may result in temporary suspension of your Skype for\n      Business account, affecting your access to important communications.</p>\n    <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this important matter.</p>\n    <p>Best regards,<br>Skype for Business Security Team<br>{{department}}</p>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>Note: For security purposes, never share your password with anyone. If you have any concerns, please contact\n        our support team immediately.</p>\n      <a href=\"#\">Support Center</a>\n      <p>&copy; 2024 Skype for Business. All Rights Reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('f5b89426-ca15-4211-9f2b-45cdc1df8ae6','RingCentral — 50% de descuento exclusivo','¡Apurate! 50% de descuento exclusivo en RingCentral','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Act Fast: Exclusive 50% Discount on RingCentral Plans Just for You!</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 20px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .header img {\n            width: 200px;\n        }\n\n        .discount {\n            background-color: #fc8b04;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .cta a {\n            display: inline-block;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            background-color: #0484bc;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #777;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img alt=\"RingCentral Logo\"\n                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        </div>\n        <h2>Act Fast: Exclusive 50% Discount on RingCentral Plans Just for You!</h2>\n        <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</p>\n        <p>We are excited to inform you about a limited-time offer exclusively for\n            our valued customers like you. RingCentral is offering an incredible 50% discount on all plans – but you\n            must act quickly to take advantage of this special deal!</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li><strong>Unbeatable Savings:</strong> Save 50% on our comprehensive communication solutions.</li>\n            <li><strong>Enhanced Features:</strong> Unlock premium features and services.</li>\n            <li><strong>oferta por tiempo limitado:</strong> This deal is available for a short period only!</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>To claim your discount, simply visit el siguiente enlace and select your desired plan. Don’t wait too long, as\n            this offer will expire soon!</p>\n        <div class=\"cta\">\n            <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\" class=\"cta\">Claim My 50%\n                    Discount Now</a>\n        </div>\n        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reply to this email, and one of our support team\n            members will be happy to help you.</p>\n        <p>Gracias por usar a valued part of the RingCentral community.</p>\n        <p><strong>Best regards,</strong><br>The RingCentral Team</p>\n        <p><strong>P.S.</strong> Remember, this oferta exclusiva won\'t last forever. Act now to enjoy the savings!</p>\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p>This email was sent to {{email}} as a registered user of RingCentral. If you believe you received this\n                message in error, please delete it immediately.</p>\n            <p>&copy; 2024 RingCentral. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('f6aaabc8-1b2e-4a82-b722-9e7524488cd7','Skype — Urgent Account Verification Request','Urgent: Immediate Action Required!','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Urgent: Immediate Action Required!</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"700\"\n        style=\"margin: auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><img alt=\"Skype for Business Logo\" width=\"200\"\n                                src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <p><b>Dear\n                            {{first_name}},</b></p>\n\n                <p>We hope this message finds you\n                        well. It has come to our attention that your Skype for Business account has not been verified.\n                        To avoid any disruption in your service, it is imperative that you verify your account\n                        immediately.</p>\n\n                <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                        style=\"background-color: #05acf4; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\">Verify\n                        Your Account Now</a></p>\n\n                <p>Failure to do so within the next\n                        24 hours will result in the suspension of your account.</p>\n\n                <p>We\n                        understand the inconvenience this may cause, and we sincerely apologize for any disruption. Our\n                        goal is to ensure your account\'s safety and uninterrupted service.</p>\n\n                <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>\n\n                <p>Best regards,<br>The Skype for Business Team</p>\n\n                <p><b>P.S. </b>If you have any questions or need further assistance, please do not hesitate to contact\n                    our support team.</p>\n\n                <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: grey;\">Note: This email is in reference to your Skype for Business\n                    account associated with {{email}}.</p>\n\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"700\" style=\"margin: auto; padding: 20px;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\">\n                <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: grey;\">This email was sent to\n                        {{email}}</p>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: grey;\">&copy; 2024 Skype for Business. All rights reserved.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('fbf71d2f-6d19-451e-b574-982ea80fc916','Skype — Restablecé tu contraseña ahora','','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n  <style>\n    .container {\n      margin: auto;\n      max-width: 700px;\n      padding: 20px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .header img {\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      color: #666;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <img alt=\"Skype for Business Logo\"\n        src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n    </div>\n    <h2>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</h2>\n    <p>Estamos constantemente esforzándonos por mantener tu cuenta de Skype for Business segura. Recientemente, se ha identificado un posible problema de seguridad, y para proteger tu cuenta, es obligatorio un restablecimiento de contraseña.</p>\n    <div style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 10px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n      <h3>Acción requerida:</h3>\n      <p>Debés restablecer tu contraseña de Skype for Business dentro de las próximas 24 horas para mantener el servicio sin interrupciones. Hacé clic en el siguiente enlace para restablecer tu contraseña de forma segura:</p>\n      <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n        style=\"background-color: #05acf4; color: #fff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px;\"><span\n          class=\"phish-technique 00qvunokwavibpg\" data-name=\"Suspicious link\" data-colour=\"#ffe099\"\n          style=\"background-color: #ffe099; outline: 3px solid #ffe099\">Restablecer mi contraseña de Skype</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <p>Si no restablecés tu contraseña dentro del tiempo asignado, podría resultar en la suspensión temporal de tu cuenta de Skype for Business, afectando tu acceso a comunicaciones importantes.</p>\n    <p>Gracias por tu pronta atención a este asunto importante.</p>\n    <p>Saludos cordiales,<br>Equipo de Seguridad de Skype for Business<br>{{department}}</p>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>Nota: Por razones de seguridad, nunca compartas tu contraseña con nadie. Si tenés alguna preocupación, contactá inmediatamente con nuestro equipo de soporte.</p>\n      <a href=\"#\">Centro de Soporte</a>\n      <p>© 2024 Skype for Business. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('fc8dcdf2-4f39-49e7-8f37-42a7fdfa7870','Microsoft Azure — Urgente: verificá tu cuenta Azure','Verificación urgente de cuenta requerida','ES','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Urgente: cuenta verificación Request</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"700\"\n        style=\"margin: auto;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td bgcolor=\"#048cd4\" style=\"padding: 20px 0; text-align: center;\">\n                <img width=\"200\" alt=\"Microsoft Azure Logo\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 20px 50px;\">\n                <p>Estimado/a {{first_name}},</p>\n                <p>Detectamos actividad inusual en tu cuenta on your Microsoft Azure cuenta and it appears to be at risk. To\n                    protect your cuenta, we need you to verify your login immediately.</p>\n                <p>Failure to take action within the\n                        next 24 hours may result in your cuenta being temporarily suspended to prevent unauthorized\n                        access.</p>\n                <p>Please click el siguiente enlace to verify your login and secure your cuenta:</p>\n                <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                        style=\"background-color: #048cd4; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;\">Verify\n                        Your Microsoft Azure Login</a></p>\n                <p>If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don\'t hesitate to contact our support\n                    team.</p>\n                <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>\n                <p>Best regards,</p>\n                <p><b>The Microsoft Azure seguridad Team</b></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td bgcolor=\"#f4f4f4\" style=\"padding: 20px 50px; text-align: center; color: #888888;\">\n                <p>&copy; 2024 Microsoft Azure. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:56:31','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('fdbcac3f-93cf-4742-a8ae-d89124de6a45','Google Cloud — Urgent Gcp Service Alert','Verify Your GCP Subscription Now','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Verify Your GCP Subscription Now</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"700\"\n        style=\"margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e9e9e9;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\">\n                <img width=\"250\" alt=\"Google Cloud Platform\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,RmlsZSBub3QgZm91bmQ6IC92MS9BVVRIX213L3dpa2lwZWRpYS1jb21tb25zLWxvY2FsLXB1YmxpYy41MS81LzUxL0dvb2dsZV9DbG91ZF9sb2dvLnBuZw==\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 20px 40px;\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #333333;\">Dear {{first_name}}\n                        {{last_name}},</h2>\n                <p>We hope this message finds you well. We are writing to inform you of an urgent matter regarding your\n                    Google Cloud Platform (GCP) subscription. Our records indicate that there is an issue that requires\n                    your immediate attention to ensure continuous service.</p>\n                <h3 style=\"color: #f48619;\">Action Required:</h3>\n                <p>Please verify your subscription details by clicking the link below to avoid any interruption to your\n                    services.</p>\n                <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                    style=\"display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; color: #ffffff; background-color: #4285f4; text-align: center; padding: 10px 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px;\">Verify\n                    Your Subscription</a>\n                <p style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Failure to address this issue within the next 24 hours will result in a\n                    temporary suspension of your GCP services. We highly encourage you to act promptly to avoid any\n                    disruption.</p>\n                <p>Thank you for your immediate attention to this urgent matter.</p>\n                <p style=\"color: #333333;\">Best regards,</p>\n                <p style=\"color: #333333;\"><b>Google Cloud Platform Support\n                            Team</b></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td\n                style=\"text-align: center; background-color: #f48619; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\">\n                <p>&copy; 2024 Google Cloud Platform. All rights reserved.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('ff046d4e-8abe-463c-85a8-bf862f4f64ee','Microsoft Azure — Exclusive Discount Offer From Microsoft Azure','Exclusive Microsoft Azure Discount Offer!','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Exclusive Microsoft Azure Discount Offer!</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n      max-width: 700px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 20px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    img {\n      max-width: 100%;\n      height: auto;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      background-color: #f4f4f4;\n      padding: 10px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <img alt=\"Microsoft Azure Logo\" width=\"200\"\n      src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n    <h2>Congratulations, {{first_name}}!</h2>\n    <p>We are excited to inform you that you\'ve been selected for a special, limited-time discount on Microsoft Azure\n      services! Take advantage of this opportunity to enhance your cloud capabilities and save on costs.</p>\n    <p><b>Redeem Your Discount Now: <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\">Redeem Your Discount</a></b></p>\n    <p>Hurry, this offer is only available for a short period. Don’t miss out on the chance to elevate your business\n      with the leading cloud platform and save!</p>\n    <p>We look forward to continuing to support your cloud journey with Microsoft Azure.</p>\n    <p><b>Best regards,</b><br>The Microsoft Azure Team</p>\n    <p><b>P.S. If you have any questions or need assistance, please don\'t hesitate to contact our support team. <a\n          href=\"{{phishing_url}}\">Contact Support</a></b></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <p>&copy; 2024 Microsoft Azure. All rights reserved.</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10'),
('ff4af4c5-b768-451a-abfc-84dd4c0ecf8b','BlueJeans — Exclusive Upgrade Offer Template','Exclusive Upgrade Offer','EN','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Exclusive Upgrade Offer</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n\n    <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"700\"\n        style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ccc;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #358dd1; text-align: center; padding: 10px;\"><img width=\"200\"\n                    alt=\"BlueJeans Logo\"\n                    src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #333;\">Hi {{first_name}},</h2>\n                <p>We’re excited to bring you an exclusive offer! For a limited time only, you can upgrade your\n                    BlueJeans account and enjoy a massive 50% discount on your subscription.</p>\n\n                <h3>Benefits of upgrading:</h3>\n                <ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n                    <li>Unlimited meeting duration</li>\n                    <li>Enhanced video and audio quality</li>\n                    <li>Priority customer support</li>\n                    <li>Advanced security features</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <p>Don’t miss\n                        out on this special opportunity to enhance your BlueJeans experience. Click the button below to\n                        upgrade your account now and claim your 50% discount:</p>\n\n                <a href=\"{{phishing_url}}\"\n                    style=\"background-color: #358dd1; color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; margin: 20px auto;\">Upgrade\n                    Now and Save 50%</a>\n\n                <p>Hurry, this offer is only valid\n                        for a short period. Upgrade today and take your online meetings to the next level!</p>\n\n                <p>Best regards,<br>The BlueJeans Team</p>\n\n                <p><b>P.S.</b> If you have\n                        any questions, feel free to reply to this email or visit our support page. Your\n                    satisfaction is our priority!</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #fbfbfb; text-align: center; padding: 10px;\">\n                <p>&copy; 2024 BlueJeans. All rights reserved.</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>\n',NULL,'ealaniz','2026-05-10 00:45:56','2026-05-10 02:05:10');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ph_landing_pages` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `html`, `capture_credentials`, `capture_passwords`, `redirect_url`, `created_by`, `created_at`) VALUES ('1ad31f5d-30e5-44bd-b54d-9c6366e8cd21','Google — Inicio de sesión','google-login','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Acceder - Cuentas de Google</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:\'Google Sans\',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;color:#202124}\n.card{width:450px;border:1px solid #dadce0;border-radius:8px;padding:48px 40px 36px}\n.logo{text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:22px;font-weight:500;color:#202124}\n.logo span{color:#4285f4}\nh1{font-size:24px;font-weight:400;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;color:#202124}\n.email-chip{text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;display:none}\n.email-chip span{border:1px solid #dadce0;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:14px}\ninput[type=email],input[type=password]{width:100%;padding:13px 16px;border:1px solid #dadce0;border-radius:4px;font-size:16px;outline:none;color:#202124;margin-bottom:8px}\ninput:focus{border-color:#1a73e8;border-width:2px;margin-bottom:7px}\n.hint{font-size:12px;color:#5f6368;margin-bottom:20px}\n.error{color:#d93025;font-size:12px;margin-top:-4px;margin-bottom:8px;display:none}\n.actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px}\n.create-btn{color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:10px 8px}\n.next-btn{background:#1a73e8;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 24px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer}\n.next-btn:hover{background:#1765cc}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"logo\"><span>G</span>oogle</div>\n  <h1>Acceder</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">Usá tu Cuenta de Google</p>\n  <form method=\"POST\" action=\"\" id=\"gForm\" novalidate>\n    <div id=\"emailStep\">\n      <div class=\"email-chip\" id=\"emailChip\"><span id=\"emailChipText\"></span></div>\n      <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Correo electrónico o teléfono\" autocomplete=\"username\" />\n      <div class=\"error\" id=\"emailError\">Ingresá una dirección de correo válida.</div>\n      <p class=\"hint\">¿Olvidaste tu correo? <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#1a73e8\">Encontralo</a></p>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"create-btn\">Crear cuenta</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"next-btn\" onclick=\"showPasswordStep()\">Siguiente</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"passwordStep\" style=\"display:none\">\n      <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Ingresá tu contraseña\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" />\n      <div class=\"error\" id=\"passError\">Contraseña incorrecta. Volvé a intentarlo.</div>\n      <a href=\"#\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none\">¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</a>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"create-btn\" onclick=\"goBack()\">Atrás</button>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"next-btn\">Siguiente</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</div>\n<script>\nfunction showPasswordStep(){\n  var e=document.getElementById(\'email\').value.trim();\n  if(!e||!/^[^@]+@[^@]+\\.[^@]+$/.test(e)){document.getElementById(\'emailError\').style.display=\'block\';return;}\n  document.getElementById(\'emailError\').style.display=\'none\';\n  document.getElementById(\'emailChipText\').textContent=e;\n  document.getElementById(\'emailChip\').style.display=\'block\';\n  document.getElementById(\'emailStep\').querySelector(\'input\').style.display=\'none\';\n  document.getElementById(\'emailStep\').querySelector(\'.hint\').style.display=\'none\';\n  document.getElementById(\'passwordStep\').style.display=\'block\';\n  document.getElementById(\'password\').focus();\n}\nfunction goBack(){\n  document.getElementById(\'passwordStep\').style.display=\'none\';\n  document.getElementById(\'emailStep\').querySelector(\'input\').style.display=\'block\';\n  document.getElementById(\'emailStep\').querySelector(\'.hint\').style.display=\'block\';\n  document.getElementById(\'emailChip\').style.display=\'none\';\n}\ndocument.getElementById(\'email\').addEventListener(\'keydown\',function(e){if(e.key===\'Enter\'){e.preventDefault();showPasswordStep();}});\ndocument.getElementById(\'gForm\').addEventListener(\'submit\',function(e){\n  if(!document.getElementById(\'password\').value){e.preventDefault();document.getElementById(\'passError\').style.display=\'block\';}\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>',1,1,'https://myaccount.google.com','ealaniz','2026-05-10 01:33:31'),
('42daca26-c179-4607-ba7e-09d56c1391a5','ARCA — Clave Fiscal','arca-clave-fiscal','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>ARCA | Portal de Contribuyentes</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#e8edf2;min-height:100vh}\nheader{background:#003366}\n.header-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 24px}\n.brand-text{color:#fff;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px}\n.brand-sub{color:#8ab4d4;font-size:11px;margin-top:1px}\n.header-bar{background:#0066cc;height:5px}\n.container{max-width:960px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 16px}\n.login-card{background:#fff;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.18);padding:36px 40px}\n.login-card h2{font-size:20px;color:#003366;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #0066cc;padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:20px}\n.info-box{background:#e8f0fb;border-left:4px solid #0066cc;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;color:#333;margin-bottom:24px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}\nlabel{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#333;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;margin-top:14px}\ninput[type=text],input[type=password]{width:100%;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #b0b8c4;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;color:#222;outline:none}\ninput:focus{border-color:#0066cc;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(0,102,204,.15)}\n.cuit-hint{font-size:11px;color:#666;margin-top:3px}\n.btn-ingresar{background:#0066cc;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:3px;padding:10px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-top:22px;width:100%}\n.btn-ingresar:hover{background:#0055aa}\n.links{margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.links a{color:#0066cc;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}\n.links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n.error{color:#c0392b;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;display:none;background:#fdf3f3;border:1px solid #e8b4b4;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:3px}\nfooter{text-align:center;color:#666;font-size:11px;padding:24px;margin-top:20px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n  <div class=\"header-top\">\n    <div><div class=\"brand-text\">ARCA</div><div class=\"brand-sub\">Agencia de Recaudación y Control Aduanero</div></div>\n    <div style=\"color:#8ab4d4;font-size:12px\">Gobierno de la República Argentina</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"header-bar\"></div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"login-card\">\n    <h2>Acceso con Clave Fiscal</h2>\n    <div class=\"info-box\">Para operar los servicios de ARCA ingresá tu CUIT/CUIL y tu Clave Fiscal.</div>\n    <form method=\"POST\" action=\"\" id=\"arcaForm\" novalidate>\n      <label for=\"cuit\">CUIT / CUIL</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"cuit\" name=\"cuit\" placeholder=\"00-00000000-0\" maxlength=\"13\" autocomplete=\"username\" />\n      <div class=\"cuit-hint\">Sin guiones o con guiones</div>\n      <label for=\"password\">Clave Fiscal</label>\n      <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Clave Fiscal\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" />\n      <div class=\"error\" id=\"loginError\">CUIT/CUIL o Clave Fiscal incorrectos.</div>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-ingresar\">INGRESAR</button>\n    </form>\n    <div class=\"links\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Blanqueo de Clave Fiscal</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Obtener Clave Fiscal</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Preguntas frecuentes</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<footer>ARCA — Agencia de Recaudación y Control Aduanero | República Argentina</footer>\n<script>\ndocument.getElementById(\'cuit\').addEventListener(\'input\',function(){this.value=this.value.replace(/[^0-9-]/g,\'\');});\ndocument.getElementById(\'arcaForm\').addEventListener(\'submit\',function(e){\n  if(!document.getElementById(\'cuit\').value||!document.getElementById(\'password\').value){\n    e.preventDefault();document.getElementById(\'loginError\').style.display=\'block\';\n  }\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>',1,1,'https://auth.afip.gob.ar/contribuyente_/login.xhtml','ealaniz','2026-05-10 01:33:31'),
('7a40ff3f-8692-4933-87a8-9b45daf00128','Microsoft — Inicio de sesión','microsoft-login','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Microsoft | Iniciar sesión</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:\'Segoe UI\',Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f3f3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh}\n.card{background:#fff;width:440px;padding:44px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}\n.logo{margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.logo-sq{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;width:20px;height:20px}\n.logo-sq span{display:block}\n.ms-brand{font-size:18px;font-weight:300;color:#1b1b1b;letter-spacing:-.3px}\nh1{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1b1b1b;margin-bottom:16px}\nlabel{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#1b1b1b;margin-bottom:4px}\ninput[type=email],input[type=password],input[type=text]{width:100%;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid #666;padding:8px 0;font-size:15px;outline:none;color:#1b1b1b;margin-bottom:24px;background:transparent}\ninput:focus{border-bottom-color:#0067b8}\n.next-btn{background:#0067b8;color:#fff;border:none;padding:8px 20px;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\n.next-btn:hover{background:#005da6}\n.error{color:#d83b01;font-size:12px;margin-top:-20px;margin-bottom:12px;display:none}\n.link{font-size:13px;color:#0067b8;text-decoration:none}\n.email-chip{font-size:13px;color:#1b1b1b;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:20px;display:none}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"logo\">\n    <div class=\"logo-sq\">\n      <span style=\"background:#f25022\"></span><span style=\"background:#7fba00\"></span>\n      <span style=\"background:#00a4ef\"></span><span style=\"background:#ffb900\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"ms-brand\">Microsoft</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Iniciar sesión</h1>\n  <form method=\"POST\" action=\"\" id=\"msForm\" novalidate>\n    <div id=\"emailStep\">\n      <label for=\"email\">Correo electrónico, teléfono o Skype</label>\n      <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"username\" />\n      <div class=\"error\" id=\"emailError\">Ingresá una dirección de correo válida.</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#444;margin-top:-16px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n        ¿No tenés cuenta? <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\">Creá una</a>\n      </p>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"next-btn\" onclick=\"showPasswordStep()\">Siguiente</button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"passwordStep\" style=\"display:none\">\n      <div class=\"email-chip\" id=\"emailChip\"></div>\n      <label for=\"password\">Contraseña</label>\n      <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" />\n      <div class=\"error\" id=\"passError\">La contraseña es incorrecta. Intentá nuevamente.</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"next-btn\">Iniciar sesión</button>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\">¿Olvidaste la contraseña?</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</div>\n<script>\nfunction showPasswordStep(){\n  var e=document.getElementById(\'email\').value.trim();\n  if(!e||!/^[^@]+@[^@]+\\.[^@]+$/.test(e)){document.getElementById(\'emailError\').style.display=\'block\';return;}\n  document.getElementById(\'emailError\').style.display=\'none\';\n  var chip=document.getElementById(\'emailChip\');\n  chip.textContent=e; chip.style.display=\'block\';\n  document.getElementById(\'emailStep\').style.display=\'none\';\n  document.getElementById(\'passwordStep\').style.display=\'block\';\n  document.getElementById(\'password\').focus();\n}\ndocument.getElementById(\'email\').addEventListener(\'keydown\',function(e){if(e.key===\'Enter\'){e.preventDefault();showPasswordStep();}});\ndocument.getElementById(\'msForm\').addEventListener(\'submit\',function(e){\n  if(!document.getElementById(\'password\').value){\n    e.preventDefault();\n    document.getElementById(\'passError\').style.display=\'block\';\n  }\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>',1,1,'https://login.microsoftonline.com','ealaniz','2026-05-10 01:33:31'),
('7d2f9d82-cc98-4140-9000-cfec2ca2ebc0','Slack — Inicio de sesión','slack-login','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Iniciar sesión en Slack</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:Lato,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f8f8f8;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;min-height:100vh}\n.topbar{width:100%;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:16px 32px}\n.topbar .brand{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#611f69;letter-spacing:-1px}\n.main{margin-top:56px;width:400px;text-align:center}\nh1{font-size:28px;color:#1d1c1d;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2}\n.sub{font-size:16px;color:#616061;margin-bottom:32px}\nlabel{text-align:left;display:block;font-size:15px;color:#1d1c1d;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}\ninput[type=email],input[type=password]{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #868686;border-radius:4px;font-size:16px;outline:none;margin-bottom:16px}\ninput:focus{border-color:#1264a3;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(18,100,163,.25)}\n.signin-btn{width:100%;background:#611f69;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;padding:13px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:16px}\n.signin-btn:hover{background:#4a154b}\n.error{color:#d72828;font-size:13px;background:#fff3f3;border:1px solid #f5aca6;padding:10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:12px;display:none;text-align:left}\n.forgot{color:#1264a3;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"brand\">slack</div></div>\n<div class=\"main\">\n  <h1>Iniciar sesión en Slack</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">Tu espacio de trabajo</p>\n  <form method=\"POST\" action=\"\" id=\"slackForm\" novalidate>\n    <label for=\"email\">Correo electrónico</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"nombre@empresa.com\" autocomplete=\"username\" />\n    <label for=\"password\">Contraseña</label>\n    <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"Contraseña\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" />\n    <div class=\"error\" id=\"loginError\">El correo o la contraseña son incorrectos.</div>\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"signin-btn\">Iniciar sesión</button>\n  </form>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"forgot\">¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</a>\n</div>\n<script>\ndocument.getElementById(\'slackForm\').addEventListener(\'submit\',function(e){\n  if(!document.getElementById(\'email\').value||!document.getElementById(\'password\').value){\n    e.preventDefault();document.getElementById(\'loginError\').style.display=\'block\';\n  }\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>',1,1,'https://slack.com/workspace-signin','ealaniz','2026-05-10 01:33:31');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ph_response_pages` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `html`, `created_by`, `created_at`) VALUES ('95ad8c35-ee6c-452e-820d-9f3f7e7b7c54','Microsoft — Aviso de seguridad','microsoft-aviso','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Aviso de seguridad — Microsoft</title>\n<style>\n  body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#f3f2f1;font-family:\'Segoe UI\',Arial,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .card{background:#fff;border-radius:4px;max-width:500px;width:calc(100% - 32px);padding:44px 48px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}\n  .ms-logo{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-bottom:28px}\n  .sq{width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:1px}\n  .ms-name{font-size:21px;color:#323130;margin-left:10px;font-weight:300;align-self:center}\n  .notice{background:#fff4ce;border:1px solid #f3d025;border-radius:4px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;color:#323130;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6}\n  h1{font-size:18px;color:#201f1e;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:600}\n  p{font-size:14px;color:#605e5c;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 14px}\n  .tip{font-size:13px;color:#323130;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edebe9;line-height:1.5}\n  .tip:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n  .tip strong{color:#0078d4}\n  .footer{font-size:11px;color:#a19f9d;margin-top:20px;line-height:1.5}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"ms-logo\">\n    <div class=\"sq\" style=\"background:#f25022\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sq\" style=\"background:#7fba00\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sq\" style=\"background:#00a4ef\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sq\" style=\"background:#ffb900\"></div>\n    <span class=\"ms-name\">Microsoft</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"notice\">⚠️ Este fue un <strong>simulacro de phishing</strong> organizado por el área de seguridad de tu organización.</div>\n  <h1>Aviso importante, {{first_name}}</h1>\n  <p>El sitio donde ingresaste tus credenciales era una <strong>página de simulacro</strong>. Tus datos no fueron almacenados ni comprometidos. Este ejercicio tiene como objetivo entrenar al equipo para detectar ataques de phishing reales.</p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#323130;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Consejos para proteger tu cuenta:</p>\n  <div class=\"tip\"><strong>Verificá la URL:</strong> microsoft.com/login es diferente a microsoft-login.net. Siempre revisá la barra de direcciones.</div>\n  <div class=\"tip\"><strong>Activá autenticación multifactor (MFA):</strong> incluso si te roban la contraseña, MFA bloquea el acceso.</div>\n  <div class=\"tip\"><strong>No reutilices contraseñas:</strong> usá un gestor de contraseñas para mantener credenciales únicas y seguras.</div>\n  <div class=\"tip\"><strong>Reportá emails sospechosos:</strong> usá el botón \"Reportar phishing\" de Outlook o notificá a sistemas.</div>\n  <div class=\"footer\">Simulacro generado por Gjallarhorn Blue Team Platform — AllSafe Security Solutions.</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>','system','2026-05-10 02:29:50'),
('9b67ff5f-ace0-4e4a-8f36-1d4d5f9af5ab','Gjallarhorn — Aviso de simulacro','gjallarhorn-simulacro','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Simulacro de Phishing — Gjallarhorn</title>\n<style>\n  body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#010409;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .card{background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #21262d;border-radius:12px;max-width:540px;width:calc(100% - 48px);padding:40px 44px}\n  .logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#388bfd;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin-bottom:4px}\n  .logo-sub{font-size:11px;color:#8b949e;margin-bottom:28px}\n  .badge{display:inline-block;background:#dc262618;color:#dc2626;border:1px solid #dc262644;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 12px;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:16px}\n  h1{font-size:20px;color:#e6edf3;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:700}\n  p{font-size:14px;color:#8b949e;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 16px}\n  .tip-block{background:#161b22;border:1px solid #21262d;border-radius:8px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .tip-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e6edf3;margin:0 0 10px}\n  .tip{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px;color:#8b949e;line-height:1.5}\n  .tip-dot{color:#388bfd;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}\n  .footer{font-size:11px;color:#484f58;margin-top:24px;line-height:1.5}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"logo\">Gjallarhorn</div>\n  <div class=\"logo-sub\">Blue Team Platform — AllSafe Security Solutions</div>\n  <span class=\"badge\">SIMULACRO DE PHISHING</span>\n  <h1>¡Atención, {{first_name}}!</h1>\n  <p>Acabás de participar en un <strong style=\"color:#e6edf3\">simulacro de phishing</strong> organizado por el área de seguridad de tu organización. El sitio donde ingresaste tus datos era falso y tus credenciales no fueron almacenadas.</p>\n  <p>Este ejercicio tiene como objetivo capacitar al equipo para identificar y reportar intentos de phishing real. El área de seguridad se comunicará con vos para coordinar la capacitación correspondiente.</p>\n  <div class=\"tip-block\">\n    <div class=\"tip-title\">Cómo identificar un email de phishing</div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><span class=\"tip-dot\">▸</span><span><strong style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Verificá el remitente:</strong> los atacantes usan dominios similares al real. Revisá la dirección completa, no solo el nombre visible.</span></div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><span class=\"tip-dot\">▸</span><span><strong style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Desconfiá de la urgencia:</strong> los emails legítimos no te presionan a actuar de inmediato bajo amenaza de suspensión de cuenta.</span></div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><span class=\"tip-dot\">▸</span><span><strong style=\"color:#e6edf3\">No hagas clic en links:</strong> ingresá directamente al sitio escribiendo la URL en el navegador.</span></div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><span class=\"tip-dot\">▸</span><span><strong style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Verificá el candado y la URL:</strong> antes de ingresar credenciales, confirmá que la URL sea correcta y el sitio tenga HTTPS.</span></div>\n    <div class=\"tip\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\"><span class=\"tip-dot\">▸</span><span><strong style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Reportá siempre:</strong> si recibís un email sospechoso, notificá al área de sistemas antes de tomar cualquier acción.</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"footer\">Este mensaje fue generado por Gjallarhorn como parte del programa de concientización en seguridad de la información.</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>','system','2026-05-10 02:29:50');
